%% One csh run (Anchor, harnesses and A3, section 4.1).
sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant CLI as csh run (cli)
  participant Run as run
  participant Harness as Harness command (project tests, probe, reporter)
  participant Adapters as Adapter subprocesses
  participant Check as check and solver
  participant Gate as gate
  participant Store as Run store (.csh-cache/runs)
  Person->>CLI: csh run, or csh run --at a commit
  CLI->>Run: runComponent, or runAt in a throwaway worktree
  Run->>Run: load csh/component.json and check it against the emitted specification
  Run->>Harness: argv per practice, with CSH_COMMIT, CSH_WITNESS_FILE, CSH_EXECUTIONS_FILE
  Harness-->>Run: exit code (a fact, never a verdict), witness and execution files
  Run->>Adapters: source bytes, execution bytes, vocabulary, bindings
  Adapters-->>Run: claims, witnesses with joined outcomes, items, diagnostics
  Run->>Check: module, adapter output, authority, owners of sources
  Check-->>Run: report
  Run->>Gate: report, snapshot with componentDigest, waivers
  Gate-->>Run: decision
  Run->>Store: run.json, report.json, gate.json
  Run-->>CLI: summary
  CLI-->>Person: exit 0, or 1 on block in enforcing mode, or 3 on dependencies-differ
